{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>已故賭王何鴻燊四房兒子何猷君（Mario）與內地超模奚夢瑤於2019年領證結婚，兩人育有大仔何廣燊（Ronaldo）和細女Romee。兩人終於在當地時間6月1日在法國舉行浪漫婚禮，並以「承諾如約而至」作為主題，其後在9月回澳門舉行答謝禮。兩人在IG分享婚禮照片，而奚夢瑤則以簡單低調的粉藍色禮服現身歡迎晚宴，優雅又得體。</p><figure><img alt=\"何猷君奚夢瑤終於在當地時間6月1日在法國舉行浪漫婚禮。（IG/@mingxi11)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260601/1138058277796843520978035.jpeg/ZBbUfApHfXmFvCc5elpOKwAPUUrxr6Ziogvbk6IL25M\"/><figcaption>何猷君奚夢瑤終於在當地時間6月1日在法國舉行浪漫婚禮。（IG/@mingxi11)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"奚夢瑤穿上低調的淺藍色禮服現身歡迎晚宴。（IG/@mingxi11)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260601/1138058275238187008561092.jpeg/xf36d_8IhKX_hVFtpBoOs3Rw_L9AFYJEU3Tbe1N023s\"/><figcaption>奚夢瑤穿上低調的淺藍色禮服現身歡迎晚宴。（IG/@mingxi11)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"奚夢瑤大曬超模身材。（IG/@mingxi11)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260601/1138058272201379840610483.jpeg/F_R752fjE9PZ6nJjUkpAnlXNXoeA7EMxWGlRpFhpUaQ\"/><figcaption>奚夢瑤大曬超模身材。（IG/@mingxi11)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"恭喜！（IG/@mingxi11)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260601/1138058269437202432397501.jpeg/-YJ_bpWbB51aizFqmmihSiJwoSx3yo2WFb0XoBW9F6A\"/><figcaption>恭喜！（IG/@mingxi11)</figcaption></figure><p>何猷君奚夢瑤曬甜蜜合照勁溫馨</p><p>在奚夢瑤及何猷君分享的靚相中，除了有兩人甜蜜對望的合照，還有賭王四太梁安琪、奚夢瑤父母、一對仔女齊齊合照，而何猷君亦曬出與四太梁安琪的溫馨合照，場面幸福有愛。另外，奧運冠軍谷愛凌亦驚喜現身祝賀好友，事後更在帖文下留言大讚奚夢瑤為「最美的新娘」。</p><figure><img alt=\"好甜蜜！（IG/@momomarioho）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260601/1138060079434567680863249.jpeg/fxH7z7SD5hJpyg-5XmLJsmoA9YmlVJhX0DA1_9AwNf8\"/><figcaption>好甜蜜！（IG/@momomarioho）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"好溫馨！（IG/@momomarioho）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260601/1138060111362134016390814.jpeg/2O7A--r7w9HVBVZMJJa8UuM_xNOGrFALWju_olo7v6I\"/><figcaption>好溫馨！（IG/@momomarioho）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"何猷君曬出與四太的母子溫馨合照。（IG/@momomarioho）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260601/1138060108874780672804236.jpeg/IHvyRcbnIaFeK2-JKi8KUqSXyqV6HHOL_0JC_v9CQv4\"/><figcaption>何猷君曬出與四太的母子溫馨合照。（IG/@momomarioho）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一對仔女都在場。（IG/@mingxi11)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260601/1138060106702000128967213.jpeg/q0_RtE8BaYm4MdiTI-lLTtm9GcwuWfKv2Jpgu9iaYLs\"/><figcaption>一對仔女都在場。（IG/@mingxi11)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"奚夢瑤對一對仔女愛護有加。（IG/@mingxi11)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260601/1138060104118177792753608.jpeg/xFvEv1K0Z10SvljpzKu5K1ruTqb7ZTATjRn_Eo0Z_xI\"/><figcaption>奚夢瑤對一對仔女愛護有加。（IG/@mingxi11)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"谷愛凌驚喜現身祝賀好友。（IG/@mingxi11)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260601/1138060101442080768962017.jpeg/ZgmTsmwLbYm6qeG2kuRo5EGndNojGkCLtdnoL7XZ6C8\"/><figcaption>谷愛凌驚喜現身祝賀好友。（IG/@mingxi11)</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-01T02:39:19.276968+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":574,"images":10,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}